index c63faeb..19e4263 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -137,3 +137,73 @@ against the reference distribution. Drift is flagged at `p < 0.05`; a
 ```json
 { "ks_statistic": 0.0, "p_value": 1.0, "drift_detected": false, "n_current": 1 }
 ```
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+![System architecture](screenshots/architecture.png)
+
+```
+EHR client → FastAPI → feature pipeline → XGBoost pipeline → risk score
+                ↓                                                  ↓
+           monitoring  ──── SQLAlchemy ────→  PostgreSQL / SQLite
+                ↓                                    ↓
+           KS drift check                    retraining DAG (weekly)
+```
+
+### Feature engineering
+
+`app/features.py` derives 26 model features from 12 raw fields:
+
+- **Lag** — `readmit_lag_flag` (discharged within 30 days),
+  `admission_velocity` (prior admissions per day since last discharge)
+- **Rolling vitals** — `vitals_instability` (heart-rate and systolic deviation
+  from clinical baseline), `glucose_deviation`
+- **Ratios** — `meds_per_diagnosis`, `labs_per_day`, `complexity_index`
+- **Encodings** — one-hot over admission type and discharge disposition
+
+All divisors are clipped, so degenerate encounters (zero diagnoses, zero-day
+stays) produce finite features rather than `NaN`.
+
+### Monitoring
+
+Every served prediction is written to `prediction_logs` with its risk score,
+label, model version and latency. `/drift` compares the trailing window of live
+scores against a reference distribution using `scipy.stats.ks_2samp`, and
+persists a `DriftReport` when the sample is large enough to be meaningful.
+
+### Retraining
+
+`pipelines/retrain_dag.py` runs extract → validate → retrain → publish. It
+refuses to promote a model whose cross-validated AUC regressed more than 0.02
+below the incumbent. The module registers an Airflow DAG
+(`care_compass_retrain`, Sundays 03:00) when Airflow is installed, and stays
+directly runnable when it is not:
+
+```bash
+python -m pipelines.retrain_dag
+```
+
+---
+
+## Project layout
+
+```
+app/
+  main.py         FastAPI app and Pydantic schemas
+  model.py        training, persistence, prediction
+  features.py     feature engineering + synthetic generator
+  monitoring.py   drift detection and prediction logging
+  database.py     SQLAlchemy models and session management
+pipelines/
+  retrain_dag.py  automated retraining
+tests/            21 tests across API, model, features, monitoring
+scripts/          architecture diagram generator
+```
+
+---
+
+## License
+
+MIT — see [LICENSE](LICENSE).
-- 
